<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">HELLO, NEW FRIEND</view><view class="heading">很高兴，和你一起轻动。</view><view class="subtitle mb">从了解自己开始，找到适合你的生活节奏。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="hero section"><view class="icon-box large"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/sprout.svg"/></view><view class="hero-title">每一个开始，都值得鼓励</view><view class="hero-desc">先用模拟账号体验轻动。你的记录仅保存在这台设备。</view><button class="btn mt" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">使用模拟账号体验 ↗</button><view class="form-hint mt">此入口不进行真实微信登录，不获取手机号。</view></view>
<block wx:else><view class="notice section mb">首次使用请确认城市，活动会按所在城市展示。健康档案仅自己可见。</view><view class="card"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">怎么称呼你</text><input class="input" maxlength="20" value="{{form.nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入你的昵称"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">所在城市 · 必选</text><picker range="{{cities}}" value="{{cityIndex}}" bindchange="selectCity"><view class="picker row"><text>{{form.city || '请选择城市'}}</text><text class="arrow">⌄</text></view></picker><view class="form-hint">当前为演示城市，报名活动后暂不能更改。</view></view><view class="grid2"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">身高 / cm · 选填</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.height}}" data-field="height" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 165"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">目标体重 / kg · 选填</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.targetWeight}}" data-field="targetWeight" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 55"/></view></view><button class="btn" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存，开始轻动 ↗</button></view><view class="notice mt"><view class="row start"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/shield.svg"/><text>昵称与城市用于活动体验，身高和目标体重不公开。</text></view></view></block>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
